:: Gwylan Hide Seek
<<effects>><<if $NPCList[0]?.fullDescription isnot "Gwylan">><<npc Gwylan>><</if>><<person1>><<run statusCheck("Gwylan")>>
<<speechresolve>>
<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
	"Gwylan, could we play hide and seek?" you ask. "If you're not busy."
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	"Would you humour me with a game of hide and seek?" you ask. "There are plenty of places to hide in here."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	"Could we play hide and seek?" you ask. "You can choose the rules."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
	"Let's play hide and seek," you say. "You know the shop better than I do, so I want to see if I can still beat you."
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
	"I'm going to hide somewhere in your shop," you tell <<him>>. "Let's see if you can actually find me."
<<else>>
	"Want to play hide and seek?" you ask. "There's plenty of room in here."
<</if>>
<br><br>
Gwylan glances along the nearest aisle, where shelves and hanging clothes leave several narrow spaces out of sight from the counter.
<br><br>
<<His>> smile grows as <<he>> puts the pestle down.
"In here? You do know I have an unfair advantage, dear. I know where everything is supposed to be, even after the shelves move."
<br><br>
You shrug, which only seems to make <<him>> more interested. Gwylan reaches up, takes off <<his>> hat and turns it over in <<his>> hands while <<he>> thinks.
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Gwylan Hide Seek 2]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Gwylan Hide Seek 2
<<effects>><<if $NPCList[0]?.fullDescription isnot "Gwylan">><<npc Gwylan>><</if>><<person1>><<run statusCheck("Gwylan")>>
"Right, here is how it goes." <<He>> taps the hat. "I cover my eyes with this and count to ten while you hide. If I find you before you tag me,
that is a point to me. If you reach me first, it is a point to you."
<br><br>
<<He>> raises three fingers. "First to three wins, and the winner gets to choose a penalty for the loser."
<br><br>
<<He>> looks around the shop once more, checking the tables and crowded shelves.
<br><br>
"After each point, the shelves shift into a different layout, so neither of us can rely on the same hiding place.
Do try not to knock anything over while you squeeze into corners. Some of these jars are terribly hard to replace."
<br><br>
Gwylan lifts the hat over <<his>> face and waits, clearly expecting you to decide.
<br><br>
<<link [[Let the counting begin|Forest Shop Hunt Intro]]>><<set $daily.gwylan.hideSeek to true>><<set $phase to "game">><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Think better of it|Forest Shop Entrance]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Gwylan Hide Seek Found
<<effects>><<if $NPCList[0]?.fullDescription isnot "Gwylan">><<npc Gwylan>><</if>><<person1>><<run statusCheck("Gwylan")>>
<<set _gs to _gwylanStatus ?? []>>
Gwylan pulls <<his>> hat off and lifts both arms in a quick little celebration.
<br><br>
"Three!" <<he>> says, before lowering them again when <<he>> sees your expression. "You made me work for the last one, dear.
I thought you were going to get past me."
<br><br>
<<if _gs.includes("cautious")>>
	<<He>> steps closer, but stops before touching you.
	<br><br>
	"Was that all right?" <<he>> asks. "If the game got to be too much, we can skip the penalty. Truly."
<<elseif (C.npc.Gwylan.dom gte 50 or _gs.includes("dom"))>>
	<<He>> steps in and straightens your collar, smoothing it back into place while <<his>> smile widens.
	<br><br>
	"I won, remember?" <<he>> says in a sing-song voice. "That means I get to choose. Do try to look less nervous. It only encourages me."
<<elseif _gs.includes("lust")>>
	<<He>> plucks a small leaf from your hair, then lets <<his>> fingers linger before drawing them away.
	"Oh, dear, I think I like winning this game more than I expected."
<<else>>
	Gwylan rocks back on <<his>> heels, still pleased with <<himself>>. "Now, what shall I do with my prize? Let me think..."
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<He>> looks towards the counter, where the ledger is still open beside the till, then back at you.
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Gwylan Hide Seek Found 2]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Gwylan Hide Seek Found 2
<<effects>><<if $NPCList[0]?.fullDescription isnot "Gwylan">><<npc Gwylan>><</if>><<person1>><<run statusCheck("Gwylan")>>
After a moment, <<he>> drags the stool closer with one foot and points to the floor beside it.
<br><br>
"I know what I want," <<he>> says, a little shyly. "Sit with me while I finish one page of the ledger.
You needn't help with anything. I'd just like the company."
<br><br>
It is a mild penalty compared with what <<he>> could have chosen,
though sitting at <<his>> feet in an open shop may be embarrassing in a different way.
<br><br>
<<link [[Take the penalty|Gwylan Hide Seek Forfeit]]>><<set $phase to 1>><<pass 20>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Take the penalty, though your face is on fire|Gwylan Hide Seek Forfeit]]>><<set $phase to 4>><<pass 20>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $gwylanSeen.includes("romance")>>
	<<link [[Offer a kiss instead|Gwylan Hide Seek Forfeit]]>><<set $phase to 2>><<npcincr Gwylan lust 1>><<pass 5>><</link>><<glust>>
<<else>>
	<<link [[Offer a kiss on the cheek instead|Gwylan Hide Seek Forfeit]]>><<set $phase to 2>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<</if>>
<br>
<<link [[Refuse|Gwylan Hide Seek Forfeit]]>><<set $phase to 3>><<pass 2>><</link>><<gwylanWillpowerDifficulty>>
<br>

:: Gwylan Hide Seek Forfeit
<<effects>><<if $NPCList[0]?.fullDescription isnot "Gwylan">><<npc Gwylan>><</if>><<person1>><<run statusCheck("Gwylan")>>
<<speechresolve>>
<<switch $phase>>
	<<case 1>>
		<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
			"All right," you say, and lower yourself beside the stool before you can become more embarrassed about it.
		<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
			"A deal is a deal," you say, taking the place <<he>> indicated.
		<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
			You nod and sit where <<he>> pointed, folding your hands in your lap while Gwylan sits above you.
		<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
			"One page," you remind <<him>> as you sit down. "Then we're even."
		<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
			"Don't get too pleased with yourself," you say as you sit. "You know every hiding place in here."
		<<else>>
			"Fine," you say, sitting beside <<his>> stool. "One page."
		<</if>>
		<br><br>
		Gwylan opens the ledger across <<his>> knees and starts where <<he>> left off.
		The first few entries are ordinary: beeswax, lamp oil, salt and a delivery that arrived two jars short.
		<br><br>
		You stop following the numbers after a while, but Gwylan reads every line with the same concentration
		<<he>> gives the stranger things in the shop.
		<br><br>
		Every so often, <<he>> reaches down without looking away from the page and runs <<his>> fingers through your hair.
		Sometimes it is only a brief scratch at your scalp; other times <<he>> pauses behind your ear before returning to the ledger.
		<br><br>
		The casual attention makes it harder to forget where you are sitting.
		<<if ["wolf", "cat", "cow", "fox", "waterdragon", "demon", "kitsune", "okami"].some(tf => Transformations.partActive(tf, "tail"))>>Your tail moves slowly across the floor beside you.
		Gwylan notices the movement and glances down, smiling to <<himself>> before continuing with the next entry.<</if>>
	<<case 4>>
		You sit on the floor at Gwylan's feet with your knees drawn close, painfully aware that the shop is still open.
		<br><br>
		The front door is behind you, and anybody who comes in will have a clear view of you beside <<his>>
		stool before they even reach the counter.
		<br><br>
		Gwylan opens the ledger and starts reading. At first you manage to keep still by concentrating on
		the rows of floorboards in front of you, but after a few minutes you hear voices outside and footsteps
		passing near the entrance.
		<br><br>
		Your attention snaps towards the door before you can stop yourself.
		<br><br>
		The footsteps carry on past the shop without the door opening, but your face stays hot.
		You tuck your legs a little closer while Gwylan turns another page above you,
		trying not to react every time somebody passes outside.
	<<case 2>>
		<<if $gwylanSeen.includes("romance")>>
			Instead of sitting down, you step into Gwylan's space and kiss <<him>>.
			<br><br>
			<<He>> freezes in surprise for less than a second before leaning into you,
			one hand sliding to the back of your neck.<<if $worn.neck.collared is 1>>
			<<His>> fingers curl around the edge of your collar, holding you close while the kiss deepens.<</if>>
		<<else>>
			You step close and kiss <<him>> on the cheek. Gwylan goes still,
			then lifts a hand to the place your lips touched after you move away.
		<</if>>
	<<default>>
		<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
			"I don't want to do that," you say, keeping your eyes low. "Could you choose something else?"
		<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
			"No, thank you," you say. "You'll have to choose another penalty."
		<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
			You hesitate before shaking your head. "I don't want that one."
		<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
			"No," you say, meeting <<his>> eyes. "I'm not doing that."
		<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
			"No chance," you tell <<him>>. "Pick something else."
		<<else>>
			"No," you say. "I'd rather not."
		<</if>>
<</switch>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Gwylan Hide Seek Forfeit End]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Gwylan Hide Seek Forfeit End
<<effects>><<if $NPCList[0]?.fullDescription isnot "Gwylan">><<npc Gwylan>><</if>><<person1>><<run statusCheck("Gwylan")>>
<<set _gs to _gwylanStatus ?? []>>
<<switch $phase>>
	<<case 1>>
		When <<he>> reaches the bottom of the page, Gwylan marks the line with one finger and closes the ledger around it.
		<br><br>
		"There, that's my page." <<He>> gives your head one last scratch,
		then shifts <<his>> feet aside so you have room to stand. "Thank you for keeping your side of the bargain."
		<<if $hypnosis_traits.devotion gte 1>>
			<<hypnosisText "After you obey, Gwylan lets you move again, and you relax.">>
		<</if>> <<stress -6>><<lstress>>
	<<case 4>>
		<<if !_gs.includes("cautious") and (C.npc.Gwylan.dom gte 50 or _gs.includesAny("dom", "lust"))>>
			After the third or fourth glance towards the entrance,
			Gwylan taps the top of your head with the end of <<his>> pencil.
			<br><br>
			You look up and find <<him>> already watching you.
			<br><br>
			"You keep looking at the door," <<he>> says. "Expecting someone?" <<He>> follows your eyes towards it,
			then sets the pencil across the ledger. "If somebody comes in, I'll tell you.
			There is no need to twist round like a startled rabbit."
			<br><br>
			<<He>> places a hand on the back of your neck and rubs <<his>> thumb slowly below your hairline.
			"Besides," <<he>> adds, more softly, "I rather like having you there."
			<br><br>
			Your face grows warmer, but the steady pressure of <<his>> hand gives you something else to focus on.
			<br><br>
			When <<he>> returns to the ledger, <<he>> keeps touching you now and then,
			scratching through your hair whenever your attention starts drifting back towards the door.
			<<npcincr Gwylan dom 1>><<npcincr Gwylan lust 1>><<stress 3>><<gstress>><<glust>>
		<<elseif _gs.includes("cautious")>>
			Gwylan reaches the middle of the page before <<he>> notices how tightly you are holding yourself.
			<<He>> closes the ledger at once and leans down until you look at <<him>>.
			<br><br>
			"Oh, that is quite enough of that," <<he>> says, with an apologetic look.
			"I wanted you a little flustered, perhaps, but I never meant you to be miserable."
			<br><br>
			<<He>> offers you a hand and waits for you to take it before helping you back to your feet.
			<<stress -3>><<lstress>>
		<<else>>
			Gwylan continues reading, but after noticing your attention drifting towards the entrance,
			<<he>> rests one hand on your shoulder. Each time you start to turn again, <<his>> fingers give a small squeeze,
			drawing your attention back before you can work yourself up over a customer who has not appeared.
			<br><br>
			By the time <<he>> reaches the final few entries, your legs are no longer held so stiffly.
			<br><br>
			Gwylan says nothing about the change, though <<his>> hand remains on you until <<he>>
			finishes the page and closes the ledger.
			<br><br>
			"That's the last entry," <<he>> says, closing the ledger and offering you a hand.
			"You survived a whole page of stock records. Most people can't." <<stress -3>><<lstress>>
		<</if>>
	<<case 2>>
		<<if $gwylanSeen.includes("romance")>>
			When you part, Gwylan remains close, looking pleased and slightly dazed.
			<<He>> touches <<his>> lower lip with one finger.
			<br><br>
			"Oh dear. That wasn't the penalty I had in mind," <<he>> says. <<His>> smile returns.
			"I like yours better." <<arousal 300>><<garousal>>
		<<else>>
			"Oh!" <<he>> says, blinking at you before the surprise turns into a smile.
			<br><br>
			"Well, I hadn't thought of that." <<He>> rubs the spot with <<his>> fingertips, then nods.
			"Yes, I think I'll take that instead."
		<</if>>
	<<default>>
		<<if $hypnosis_traits.devotion gte 1 and !$willpowerSuccess and !_gs.includes("cautious")>>
			You mean to remain standing, but you have barely finished speaking before your knees begin to bend.
			<br><br>
			You try to straighten them and take a step away, only for your body to lower itself beside Gwylan's stool instead.
			<<hypnosisText "You refused, yet your body sits where Gwylan wanted before you can stop it.">>
			<br><br>
			Gwylan's pleased expression fades when <<he>> sees the struggle on your face.
			<br><br>
			<<He>> watches you try to straighten your legs, then lays the ledger across <<his>> knees and
			rests a hand on your head. <<He>> reads without teasing you, keeping the touch light until the page
			is finished and you can move again. <<trauma 4>><<gtrauma>>
		<<elseif _gs.includes("cautious")>>
			Gwylan nods as soon as you refuse and puts the ledger back on the counter. <<He>> does not try to bargain with you.
			"Then forget the penalty, dear," <<he>> says. "Shall I put the kettle on?"
		<<elseif C.npc.Gwylan.dom gte 50>>
			Gwylan studies your face before closing the ledger.
			<br><br>
			Disappointment crosses <<his>> expression, but <<he>> does not reach for you. "Oh, spoilsport. It was only a game,"
			<<he>> says, returning the book to the counter and leaving the matter there.
		<<else>>
			Gwylan sighs and sets the ledger aside. "Next time I'll think of something less embarrassing."
			<br><br>
			<<Hes>> still disappointed, but a small smile returns before <<he>> turns back to you.
		<</if>>
<</switch>>
<br><br>
<<gwylanOptions>>

:: Gwylan Hide Seek Won
<<effects>><<if $NPCList[0]?.fullDescription isnot "Gwylan">><<npc Gwylan>><</if>><<person1>><<run statusCheck("Gwylan")>>
Gwylan reaches for you too late, and your hand lands on <<him>> first. <<He>> stares at the point of contact,
then at you, before dropping onto the nearest stool with a laugh and pushing <<his>> hat back from <<his>> forehead.
<br><br>
"Three!" <<he>> says, sounding both impressed and offended by the number. "You beat me in my own shop.
And I was so sure I had the advantage."
<br><br>
<<He>> props one elbow on the counter and gestures towards you with the other hand. "The penalty is yours,
winner. What shall it be?"
<br><br>
<<link [[Ask for a head scratch|Gwylan Hide Seek Prize]]>><<set $phase to 1>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Ask for the ginger tin|Gwylan Hide Seek Prize]]>><<set $phase to 2>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Give an order of your own|Gwylan Hide Seek Prize]]>><<set $phase to 3>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<br>

:: Gwylan Hide Seek Prize
<<effects>><<if $NPCList[0]?.fullDescription isnot "Gwylan">><<npc Gwylan>><</if>><<person1>><<run statusCheck("Gwylan")>>
<<speechresolve>>
<<switch $phase>>
	<<case 1>>
		<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
			"Could I have a head scratch?" you ask, touching the side of your head. "If that's all right."
		<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
			"I think I'll claim a head scratch," you say. "That seems fair."
		<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
			"A head scratch, please," you say, already edging a little closer.
		<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
			"I want a head scratch," you say. "You owe me one."
		<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
			"You can start by scratching my head," you tell <<him>>, unable to hide how pleased you are with winning.
		<<else>>
			"A head scratch," you decide. "That's my prize."
		<</if>>
		<br><br>
		Gwylan's eyebrows rise, and <<he>> looks briefly surprised that you chose something so simple.
		<<if $gwylan.timer.petBed gte Time.date.timeStamp>><<He>> sits on the edge of the pet bed and pats the cushion beside <<him>>.<<else>>
		<<He>> pulls another stool close to <<his>> own and pats the seat.<</if>> "Come here, dear."
	<<case 2>>
		<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
			"Could I have some of your ginger?" you ask, glancing towards the tin.
		<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
			"I'll take some of the ginger, if you please," you say.
		<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
			"The ginger," you say, pointing towards the tin. "Just a little."
		<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
			"I want the ginger tin," you say, holding out your hand.
		<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
			"Hand over the ginger," you say, holding out your palm. "You lost."
		<<else>>
			"I'll take the ginger," you say.
		<</if>>
		<br><br>
		Gwylan reaches towards the tin automatically, then pauses with <<his>> hand around it.
		<<He>> looks from the tin to you, pulls it against <<his>> chest and narrows <<his>> eyes.
		<br><br>
		"Ooh, the ginger?" <<he>> asks. "You could have chosen nearly anything in the shop,
		and you've gone straight for the expensive jar."
	<<default>>
		<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
			"Could you sit down for me?" you ask. Now that it is your turn to give the order,
			the words feel stranger than you expected.
		<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
			"Sit for me, please," you say, gesturing towards the floor.
		<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
			You hesitate, then point to the floor. "Sit down for me."
		<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
			"Sit down," you tell <<him>>, pointing to the floorboards.
		<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
			"My turn," you say, pointing down. "Sit."
		<<else>>
			"Sit," you say, pointing to the floor.
		<</if>>
		<br><br>
		Gwylan's eyebrows lift. <<He>> looks at the exact spot you indicated, then back at you,
		and <<his>> smile slowly widens. Instead of moving at once, <<he>> waits to see whether you will repeat yourself.
<</switch>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Gwylan Hide Seek Prize End]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Gwylan Hide Seek Prize End
<<effects>><<if $NPCList[0]?.fullDescription isnot "Gwylan">><<npc Gwylan>><</if>><<person1>><<run statusCheck("Gwylan")>>
<<switch $phase>>
	<<case 1>>
		You sit beside <<him>>, your shoulder brushing <<his>> arm.
		<br><br>
		Gwylan spreads <<his>> fingers through your hair and scratches slowly over your scalp,
		paying particular attention to the places that make you lean towards <<his>> hand.
		<br><br>
		When <<he>> reaches the back of your head, <<his>> fingertips work down to the top of your neck before circling back again.
		<<if ["wolf", "cat", "cow", "fox", "bunny", "bear", "waterdragon", "kitsune", "okami"].some(tf => Transformations.partActive(tf, "ears"))>>
			<br><br>
			As <<he>> rubs carefully around the base of your ears, they twitch under <<his>> fingers.
			Your shoulders loosen, and you tilt your head to give <<him>> better access before you realise what you are doing.
			<br><br>
			Gwylan notices immediately and adjusts <<his>> hand rather than commenting on it,
			scratching there until the tension leaves your neck.
		<</if>>
		<br><br>
		By the time <<he>> finally stops, your scalp tingles pleasantly and turning your head no longer pulls at the muscles in your neck.
		<br><br>
		Gwylan smooths your hair back down with both hands. "What a very easy penalty," <<he>> says,
		still looking amused by your choice. <<stress -8>><<lstress>>
	<<case 2>>
		You keep your hand out, waiting for the ginger tin. Gwylan looks at the tin, then at you,
		and holds onto it for another moment before finally placing it in your palm with a sigh.
		<br><br>
		<<He>> watches while you choose a sugar-coated piece and bite into it;
		the sweetness turns quickly into the warmer heat underneath,
		and <<he>> laughs when your expression changes.
		<br><br>
		"You did ask for it," <<he>> says with a giggle,
		taking the tin back before you can decide whether winning entitles you to a second piece.<<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<<default>>
		<<if C.npc.Gwylan.dom gte 50>>
			Gwylan remains standing after the order, studying you until you begin to wonder whether
			<<he>> intends to refuse. Then <<he>> lowers <<himself>> onto the floorboards without looking away from you.
			<br><br>
			<<He>> sits exactly where you pointed, folds <<his>> legs comfortably and waits.
			<br><br>
			Once seated, Gwylan makes <<himself>> comfortable and looks up at you without any embarrassment.
			<br><br>
			<<He>> keeps watching your face, curious to see what you will do now that <<he>> has followed the order,
			and <<his>> smile grows when you do not immediately back down. <<npcincr Gwylan lust 2>><<glust>>
		<<else>>
			Gwylan sits cross-legged on the floor with <<his>> hat in <<his>> lap, looking delighted by the reversal.
			<br><br>
			"Oh, I did wonder whether you'd try that," <<he>> says. <<He>> rests
			<<his>> hands on <<his>> knees and tips <<his>> head up towards you. "Let's see what you do with me now."
		<</if>>
<</switch>>
<br><br>
<<gwylanOptions>>

:: Gwylan Amends
<<effects>><<if $NPCList[0]?.fullDescription isnot "Gwylan">><<npc Gwylan>><</if>><<person1>><<run statusCheck("Gwylan")>>
<<set _gs to _gwylanStatus ?? []>>
<<set $daily.gwylan.amends to true>>
<<set $gwylan.amends to {}>>
<<speechresolve>>
<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
	"Gwylan... can we talk?" you ask. "I know I upset you, and I want to make it right."
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	"Gwylan, I owe you an apology," you say. "If you'll hear me out."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	"I know I was wrong," you say. "Tell me what you need from me."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
	"I know I hurt you," you say. "I came back to apologise properly."
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
	"I know I went too far," you say, making yourself look at <<him>>. "I'm here, so say what you need to say."
<<else>>
	"Gwylan, about earlier..." You shift your weight before continuing. "I want to put it right."
<</if>>
<br><br>
Gwylan does not answer at once. <<He>> finishes what <<hes>> doing with the ledger,
but the usual easy smile is missing, and the silence makes it clear that <<he>> has not simply forgotten what happened.
<br><br>
<<if _gs.includes("cautious")>>
	<<He>> sets the pen down and keeps both hands on the counter. "I was hoping you'd come back," <<he>> says.
	"Say what you came to say. I'll listen." <<He>> hesitates before adding, "I may still want a little time afterwards."
<<elseif (C.npc.Gwylan.dom gte 50 or _gs.includes("dom"))>>
	Gwylan puts the pen aside and looks at you properly. "You hurt me."
	<<His>> fingers remain on the edge of the ledger, bending the page beneath them.
	"I kept thinking about it after you left, and I want to know you understand why."
<<else>>
	Gwylan stops writing and rubs a hand across <<his>> face before looking at you.
	<br><br>
	"I wondered if you'd come back," <<he>> says. The tired note in <<his>> voice makes your stomach tighten.
	"Oh dear, I don't like being cross with you. If you've come to apologise, I'll hear it."
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Apologise plainly|Gwylan Amends Apology]]>><<stress 2>><</link>>
<br>
