:: Gwylan Amends Apology
<<effects>><<if $NPCList[0]?.fullDescription isnot "Gwylan">><<npc Gwylan>><</if>><<person1>><<run statusCheck("Gwylan")>>
<<set _gs to _gwylanStatus ?? []>>
<<speechresolve>>
<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
	"I'm sorry," you begin. The first words come quietly, but you make yourself continue. "I hurt you.
	I shouldn't have treated you like that."
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	"I treated you badly, and you didn't deserve it," you say. "I'm sorry, Gwylan."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	"I did what I wanted without stopping to think about what I was doing to you," you say. "I'm sorry.
	I won't do that again."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
	"I know where I crossed the line," you say. "I hurt you, and I'm sorry."
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
	You begin with your arms folded, then let them drop to your sides. "I went too far.
	You didn't deserve that from me, and I'm sorry."
<<else>>
	"I hurt you, and I'm sorry," you say. "I should have stopped before it went that far."
<</if>>
<br><br>
Gwylan listens without interrupting. <<He>> looks down once while you are speaking, but does not turn away,
and when you finish the silence stretches until you have to resist the urge to start explaining yourself again.
<br><br>
<<if _gs.includes("cautious")>>
	Gwylan finally nods. "Thank you. I think you mean it." <<He>> picks up the pen,
	then sets it down again without writing. "I'd still like today to myself.
	Come back tomorrow, and I'll be better company."
	<<set $gwylan.punishment to false>><<unset $gwylan.amends>>
	<br><br>
	<<gwylanOptions>>
<<elseif (C.npc.Gwylan.dom gte 50 or _gs.includes("dom"))>>
	Gwylan looks down at <<his>> hands before answering. "I believe you."
	<br><br>
	<<He>> takes a slow breath and looks towards the shelves at the back of the shop.
	"Stay with me a little longer. Stand in the corner while I finish this page, and wait until I come to you.
	If you want to stop before then, tell me."
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Go to the corner|Gwylan Amends Corner]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Say that was all you came to do|Gwylan Amends Done]]>><<set $gwylan.amends.doneReason to "apology">><</link>>
<<else>>
	Gwylan comes out from behind the counter and reaches for your hands. <<His>> grip closes around them
	more firmly than usual once you let <<him>> take them.
	<br><br>
	"Thank you," <<he>> says. "I wasn't sure you understood how much it hurt."
	<<He>> rubs one thumb over your knuckles while studying your face. "I needed to hear you say it."
	<<set $gwylan.punishment to false>><<unset $gwylan.amends>>
	<<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<gwylanOptions>>
<</if>>

